    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "You can earn bonus Coins for:\nBatting:\n* Fours hit: 4 Coins\n* Sixes
    hit: 6 Coins\n* Good shots (more than 2 runs taken): 2 Coins\n* Fifties hit:
    10 Coins\n* Centuries hit: 20 Coins\n\n\nHitting sixes will also fill the Arcade
    Bar from 0 to 30 and give you 3 Arcade Tickets when filled.\n\n\nBowling:\nYou
    can earn bonus Coins for:\n* Dot balls: 2 Coins\n* Wickets taken through \"bowled\":
    6 Coins\n* Wickets taken through wickie or C&B catch: 4 Coins\n* Wickets taken
    through other means: 3 Coins\n\n\nBatting Multiplayer: \nIn public mode, coins
    are awarded for all players (except for the player finishing last). The rewards
    are as follows:\n*1st place: 1000 coins\n*2nd place: 750 coins\n*3rd place: 500
    coins\n*4th place: 250 coins"
