  m_Text: "In this mode you will be provided with six levels starting from beginner.
    Each level will have 5 set of challenges with increased scores to be chased inside
    them. Beat these 5 match challenges to finish of a level and move on to the next
    level till you master the runs.\n\n\nLevels to be faced:\n1. CUB CLASS \n2. YOUNG
    LION\n3. POWER PLAYER"
